@page "/"

<h2>RocketWelder SDK Blazor Sample</h2>

<p>
    This sample demonstrates the RocketWelder SDK for rendering ML results in Blazor WASM.
</p>

<h3>Available Demos:</h3>
<ul>
    <li><a href="/segmentation">Segmentation Demo</a> - Render segmentation polygons with delta-encoded points</li>
    <li><a href="/keypoints">KeyPoints Demo</a> - Render keypoints with master/delta frame support</li>
    <li><a href="/multi-stream">Multi-Stream Demo</a> - Composite rendering of multiple streams on single canvas</li>
</ul>

<h3>Architecture:</h3>
<pre>
Server (ASP.NET Core)              WASM Client (Browser)
+-----------------------+          +--------------------------------+
| ML Results Generator  |   →      | RenderingStreamV2              |
| - Encode with SDK     | Binary   | ┌─ Decode Thread (WebSocket)   |
| - Delta compression   | Stream   | │  - BinaryFrameReader          |
+-----------------------+  (WS)    | │  - Draw to IStage             |
                                   | ├─ Thread-safe frame handoff    |
                                   | └─ Render Thread (EnableLoop)   |
                                   |    - TryCopyFrame()             |
                                   |    - Draw layers to SKCanvas    |
                                   +--------------------------------+
</pre>

<h3>Key Features:</h3>
<ul>
    <li>Zero-allocation binary encoding with BinaryFrameWriter/Reader</li>
    <li>Delta compression for efficient point encoding</li>
    <li>Master/Delta frames for temporal compression</li>
    <li>WASM-compatible (no transport dependencies)</li>
</ul>
